data: {"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"lookupStatus\": \"found\",\n    \"comments\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"Y29tbWVudDozMDUxNzY2NzA4MzM2NDE3XzMwNTM3NzAwMDE0Njk0MjE=\",\n        \"text\": \"Anonymous, on another note - you don’t need it.  My son will be an incoming freshman this year playing college ball.  We bought NCSA and never needed it.  You can do everything yourself with emails, phone calls, video.  You do have to promote yourself and keep track of who you contact and when but you can do all of that with a spreadsheet or any other planning tool.\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2025-08-02T17:55:51.000Z\",\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"reactionCount\": 1,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"name\": \"Ashley Geraci Volante\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"pfbid05up6gZDPfTdDxPAnBK2uyN8sfbgEWC3S77rGz7QJM5XoUEaA3oAwFyuvgZDrdZKJl\",\n          \"shortName\": \"Ashley\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"Y29tbWVudDozMDUxNzY2NzA4MzM2NDE3XzMwNTM3MTU3NjE0NzQ4NDU=\",\n        \"text\": \"We did it and I regret it.  Don’t do it.  It’s too expensive and it’s not worth it.\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2025-08-02T16:45:49.000Z\",\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"reactionCount\": 2,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"name\": \"Ashley Geraci Volante\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"pfbid05up6gZDPfTdDxPAnBK2uyN8sfbgEWC3S77rGz7QJM5XoUEaA3oAwFyuvgZDrdZKJl\",\n          \"shortName\": \"Ashley\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"Y29tbWVudDozMDUxNzY2NzA4MzM2NDE3XzMwNTI5ODA2NzgyMTUwMjA=\",\n        \"text\": \"I’m not sure how old your child is and for what sport, but when my child was in high school and attending ID camps, most college coaches said they would rather deal directly with the parent than an agency.\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2025-08-02T02:08:55.000Z\",\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"reactionCount\": 2,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"name\": \"Amanda Duquette Scheidemantel\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"pfbid031cV1NBiVVMKAcsQurNvDpDVgY3pPaWRGnU7PtnN71LMGy9uzUcpeABTBQKZGaZWal\",\n          \"shortName\": \"Amanda\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"Y29tbWVudDozMDUxNzY2NzA4MzM2NDE3XzMwNTI5NTYxNjgyMTc0NzE=\",\n        \"text\": \"Please don’t waste your money on that , you’ll do better going to camps and combines\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2025-08-02T01:33:36.000Z\",\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"reactionCount\": 1,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"name\": \"Anonymous participant 244\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"702607306143650\",\n          \"shortName\": null\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"Y29tbWVudDozMDUxNzY2NzA4MzM2NDE3XzMwNTI5NTMxNjgyMTc3NzE=\",\n        \"text\": \"It is too much money.  However, we did it because they offered us a discounted cost and we didn’t know better.  My husband actually really liked using it to organize the timeline of when to contact they gave you.  My son did not email through it.  Used it as more of an organization tool since we already paid for it and had it available.  If you are good on creating something on excel, just do that.\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2025-08-02T01:29:25.000Z\",\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"reactionCount\": 1,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"name\": \"Theresa Rucker\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"pfbid04qLvHPsCo8wsDyV9RFqHBPT9Y8hQAzURnkgwgoVKSVdzz1BFNpvpv1wj3KXGjwRml\",\n          \"shortName\": \"Theresa\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"Y29tbWVudDozMDUxNzY2NzA4MzM2NDE3XzMwNTI4OTkyMzE1NTY0OTg=\",\n        \"text\": \"Please don't, huge waste of money\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2025-08-01T23:57:39.000Z\",\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"reactionCount\": 1,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"name\": \"Chris Bence\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"100002042567135\",\n          \"shortName\": \"Chris\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"Y29tbWVudDozMDUxNzY2NzA4MzM2NDE3XzMwNTE4OTg0MjgzMjMyNDU=\",\n        \"text\": \"Scam. Totally useless and won’t do anything but take your money\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2025-08-01T04:18:12.000Z\",\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"reactionCount\": 1,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"name\": \"Elisabeth Rasheed\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"pfbid02XPrv6Eu2nMFw5L5dEmtgDGsXUymm12qPm4m4iNXtgZohKTgnv3R4o6zgUymVhAR6l\",\n          \"shortName\": \"Elisabeth\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"Y29tbWVudDozMDUxNzY2NzA4MzM2NDE3XzMwNTE4NzYzMzE2NTg3ODg=\",\n        \"text\": \"Reviews are horrible. Many said that you pay and do the work. Plus they are out of state which was a red flag for me. Rep couldnt even say our school name correctly. I think recruiters having a relationship with our coaches and seeing our students play is a better route as well as the different sites that your students stats can be on. IMO\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2025-08-01T03:46:10.000Z\",\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"reactionCount\": 2,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"name\": \"Athena Sparkles\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"pfbid02KDGjLymCEXZsEFrPZdCegNDdAVyUd9R8jeC5EuUTEgUX3M6ME9gR7NTMxkuTy9NLl\",\n          \"shortName\": \"Athena\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"Y29tbWVudDozMDUxNzY2NzA4MzM2NDE3XzMwNTE4NjE0MzQ5OTM2MTE=\",\n        \"text\": \"Used, scam\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2025-08-01T03:22:39.000Z\",\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"reactionCount\": 2,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"name\": \"Genia Holmes Cole\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"pfbid02sV8gchvJVGPkCbBY2X1cukouC6ZYuRuJKPAuuPBM6v9g923mg77V9pzFKSDecwPVl\",\n          \"shortName\": \"Genia\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"Y29tbWVudDozMDUxNzY2NzA4MzM2NDE3XzMwNTE4NTc1NDQ5OTQwMDA=\",\n        \"text\": \"Follow this group. https://www.facebook.com/share/g/1YcmT7wFuM/?mibextid=wwXIfr\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2025-08-01T03:16:43.000Z\",\n        \"replyCount\": 1,\n        \"reactionCount\": 2,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"name\": \"Janelle Evans Landry\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"pfbid02DhcZsmerttGDA4SZvEhp7GukJzUMa4YNfwo6dMft64QsWKABBgmwTAHrJjU93JRJl\",\n          \"shortName\": \"Janelle\"\n        }\n      }\n    ],\n    \"page\": {\n      \"nextCursor\": \"MToxNzkzOTg0NTcwOgF_x4lYk2uYPiiqmfEF7h0kGxr5khcwOxRB5uV1usTw6AlXujB5MtI6Magt955C81hBmCycNpt7Brek_XhndCVo0b-F9sDww4SZjXQV3L5YpIBp0kFC3n-87Nvo1My-2C2VuatyjhtPD3z4CHP12C_W1kzTZMysqfQkz37svj7xkO-p-Edwh9kPapZPkG8J_fDemgn96RY88-J5CPA5DcpSdVL9ezzSYaNGMaGW4WapXWTHOCbI7NEF2iqm2h0reuFfJoFmseBxaqHR88wfb51xbWfOcT2snlKXlqMQ-YGTcs66sFelVYSaS1MYtdy4l43eKheQokoGm0lW_wlQr-TNCB_BkenCBW6-X-EmtdKw2-AWDivBiBmRItPN7hKif4do08_bSVi-Vo3fGhlcZEtkMLCIPH9aTGc26s8Q8g_PCQeiX9jvpQdgk-s\",\n      \"hasMore\": true\n    }\n  },\n  \"meta\": {\n    \"requestId\": \"req_aa40a0cd-9a58-43fa-9ec3-634b963d7342\",\n    \"creditsCharged\": 1,\n    \"version\": \"v1\"\n  }\n}"},{"type":"text","text":"{\"conversation_id\":\"01a1b1d0-1ae3-766f-bb85-c946893505d8\"}"}],"structuredContent":{"data":{"lookupStatus":"found","comments":[{"id":"Y29tbWVudDozMDUxNzY2NzA4MzM2NDE3XzMwNTM3NzAwMDE0Njk0MjE=","text":"Anonymous, on another note - you don’t need it.  My son will be an incoming freshman this year playing college ball.  We bought NCSA and never needed it.  You can do everything yourself with emails, phone calls, video.  You do have to promote yourself and keep track of who you contact and when but you can do all of that with a spreadsheet or any other planning tool.","createdAt":"2025-08-02T17:55:51.000Z","replyCount":0,"reactionCount":1,"replies